            X_clients.obj-type = substring(v-cli-string, 1, 3)
        and X_clients.obj-code = integer(substring(v-cli-string, 4)) no-error.
  RUN Myenable.
  WAIT-FOR GO OF FRAME Dialog-Frame.
END.
